Package: latchverify
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 22)
Suggests: git
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @PACKAGER@
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: capability-diffing security proxy for MCP servers
 LatchVerify pins Model Context Protocol tool definitions in a git-committed
 latch.lock and blocks tools/call when a tool gains capabilities without
 review. Includes the `latch` command and a desktop launcher for the local
 review UI.
